**Roadmap & Next Steps:** We propose a phased implementation: 

| Milestone              | Deliverable                             | Experiment/Test                                       |
|------------------------|-----------------------------------------|-------------------------------------------------------|
| **M1: Concept Definition**  | Refined definitions + grounding protocols | Expert review of definitions; pilot grounding tasks |
| **M2: Prototype UI/Loop**   | Clickable Beefythiq demo (Mermaid mockup and basic KG) | Usability test of progressive graph interface        |
| **M3: Iterative Engine**    | Implement GENERATE/STEER/GROUND modules; HITL loop integration | Benchmark generation/grounding quality vs. baseline   |
| **M4: Evaluation Suite**    | Metrics implementation (girth, novelty, etc.)       | User study measuring steering effectiveness & metrics |
| **M5: Refinement & Scale**  | Scaled KG, performance optimization             | Longitudinal study of Beefythiq in research task      |

Each milestone builds on the previous: first lock down definitions and tests, then develop UI, then complete the loop, and finally rigorously evaluate. This roadmap, together with the actionable recommendations above, ensures Beefythiq becomes a “beefy” semantic tool – powerful, steerable, and trustworthy. 

